{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:37:02+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SkyKeepers", "steam_appid": 568180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "SkyKeepers is a hardcore action platformer following the journey of Tangi as he desperately fights to restore his village and preserve his way of life. Help Tangi defeat mysterious spirit monsters with powerful combo moves and slick teleportation features. With a surprise emotional twist - SkyKeepers subtly explores the nature of loss, grief, and acceptance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/extras/59b0ed59e5eafbf64bd0ddea04f29dac.avif?t=1547844695\" width=616 height=122 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Chief fighting to recover</h2><br>A tragic accident spirals Tangi into despair, turning him to stone. Unprotected, the village suffers onslaught after onslaught of unkept hostile spirits, called Wa'Kine, who now flood the islands. A year passes before Tangi awakes, emerging from his skin of stone to give witness to the devastation of his absence. Picking up his axe, he must conquer the demons of these lands to rebuild his village. To rebuild himself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/extras/9097843ef62c970ca0b9ac6f0d3ba5e4.avif?t=1547844695\" width=616 height=122 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clever 2D combat with a twist, keep your combo going and your enemies airborne by teleporting to them mid-flight<br></li><li>Unique journey through a fantasy world inspired by oceanic Austronesian culture<br></li><li>Customize how you fight with unique special attacks then craft crests that alter and change your attacks letting you customize how you play<br></li><li>Intuitive controls that let you get in the action and stay there<br></li><li>Craft daggers, bombs and potions to help you dispatch the Wa'Kine<br></li><li>An impactful story that explores the stages of grief<br></li><li>Charming and distinctive art that creates a striking visual experience</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/extras/78d8bff3da81562594ad0269edeb9ee1.avif?t=1547844695\" width=616 height=122 /></span>", "about_the_game": "SkyKeepers is a hardcore action platformer following the journey of Tangi as he desperately fights to restore his village and preserve his way of life. Help Tangi defeat mysterious spirit monsters with powerful combo moves and slick teleportation features. With a surprise emotional twist - SkyKeepers subtly explores the nature of loss, grief, and acceptance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/extras/59b0ed59e5eafbf64bd0ddea04f29dac.avif?t=1547844695\" width=616 height=122 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Chief fighting to recover</h2><br>A tragic accident spirals Tangi into despair, turning him to stone. Unprotected, the village suffers onslaught after onslaught of unkept hostile spirits, called Wa'Kine, who now flood the islands. A year passes before Tangi awakes, emerging from his skin of stone to give witness to the devastation of his absence. Picking up his axe, he must conquer the demons of these lands to rebuild his village. To rebuild himself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/extras/9097843ef62c970ca0b9ac6f0d3ba5e4.avif?t=1547844695\" width=616 height=122 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clever 2D combat with a twist, keep your combo going and your enemies airborne by teleporting to them mid-flight<br></li><li>Unique journey through a fantasy world inspired by oceanic Austronesian culture<br></li><li>Customize how you fight with unique special attacks then craft crests that alter and change your attacks letting you customize how you play<br></li><li>Intuitive controls that let you get in the action and stay there<br></li><li>Craft daggers, bombs and potions to help you dispatch the Wa'Kine<br></li><li>An impactful story that explores the stages of grief<br></li><li>Charming and distinctive art that creates a striking visual experience</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/extras/78d8bff3da81562594ad0269edeb9ee1.avif?t=1547844695\" width=616 height=122 /></span>", "short_description": "SkyKeepers is a 2D action platformer following the journey of Tangi, as he desperately fights to reclaim both his world and life. Seamlessly chain together various attacks, launching foes skyward. When they’re airborne, teleport to your still hurtling foes to maintain the onslaught in visceral mid-air combat.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“I’m not kidding; this is some of the finest gameplay I’ve had the pleasure of experiencing in a platformer ever”<br>Gaming Respawn<br><br>“If you want a game with a solid platforming base and a lot of challenging gameplay, pick up an axe and enter the village of SkyKeeper.”<br>The Xbox Hub<br><br>“The platforming and traversal in SkyKeepers is some of the most fun and fluid gameplay they I’ve experienced in a 2d platformer.”<br>This Gen Gaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/header.jpg?t=1547844695", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1547844695", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1547844695", "website": "http://skykeepersgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz dual core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4400 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sword Twin Studios Ltd."], "publishers": ["Sword Twin Studios Ltd."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 29, "description": "Steam Trading Cards"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 43, "description": "Remote Play on TV"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/ss_8801928d163dad488bfa4234ed2efbcc0033fdc9.600x338.jpg?t=1547844695", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/ss_8801928d163dad488bfa4234ed2efbcc0033fdc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1547844695"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/ss_1652211561c9cb90356beb31e84a1280752d8192.600x338.jpg?t=1547844695", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/ss_1652211561c9cb90356beb31e84a1280752d8192.1920x1080.jpg?t=1547844695"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/568180/ss_68d8161d4d80f67fce14975e24e4772c86e19755.600x338.jpg?t=1547844695", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.